# IaC dev allowances: public IP + TLS not enforced by resource attribute
# Dev DB currently keeps a public IP for proxy-less access; plan documented to move to private IP + TLS-only.
AVD-GCP-0015
AVD-GCP-0017

# Container-scan (apps/api FastAPI image): pip-vendored deps, not app deps.
# pip (26.x) vendors msgpack==1.1.2 and setuptools==70.3.0 for its own internal
# use — pip/_vendor/vendor.txt + pip/_vendor/bom.cdx.json list them, in both the
# app venv's pip and the base image's /usr/local pip. Nothing in
# apps/api/requirements.txt pulls these, and pip is never invoked at runtime
# (the container's entrypoint is `uvicorn`). The latest pip still vendors these
# exact versions, so no upstream bump clears them. Revisit if a future pip
# re-vendors patched copies, or if pip is stripped from the runtime image.
# msgpack — out-of-bounds read / crash; only reachable via pip's own HTTP cache.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
# setuptools — PackageIndex path traversal; only reachable during pip installs.
CVE-2025-47273
